  "description": "Ever since the day she lost her temper at a manspreader on a hellishly crowded subway, Hyun Yura has possessed a strange ability: she can see men’s private parts. First came the shock, followed by confusion. But now, four years later, Yura has finally managed to adjust to her peculiar everyday life. At least, until an overwhelming presence suddenly dominates her field of vision. Its owner is none other than Lee Jangbum, her junior colleague at work. At first glance, he appears to be an aloof and quiet nerd. But the closer she gets to him, the more she discovers his flawless physique, beastlike stamina, and that overwhelmingly endowed attribute. \n\n“Senior, you’re too tight. Try to relax.”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079849)",
